    {
      "id": "seg:code:declaration:0006:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nfunc prepareRouteSelectionForPlayback() async -> (Bool, AVAudioSession.RouteSelection)\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nfunc prepareRouteSelectionForPlayback() async -> (Bool, AVAudioSession.RouteSelection)\n```",
      "sourceHash": "3e20137d7b65b736ffd5214029988a47140b5b0f527ef123e066d90e8adfa2cb",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:heading:discussion:0007:0001",
      "source": "Discussion",
      "ko": "Discussion",
      "sourceHash": "5eb6cf647d2c5d14a044e2d103dcef4cf0cdc872434c374debc1043092bc4746",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "When playing long-form video content, call this method to indicate that playback is about to begin.",
      "ko": "긴 형식 비디오 콘텐츠를 재생할 때 재생이 곧 시작됨을 알리기 위해 이 메서드를 호출합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "f20222790b66ad566ac6ef8f0fc295d6671e2090cc7032272cbc1415d5527836",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "Doing so provides the system the opportunity to prompt the user for an output destination, if needed, and perform any required routing.",
      "ko": "이렇게 하면 시스템이 필요한 경우 출력 대상을 사용자에게 요청하고 필요한 라우팅을 수행할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "4d20acba35442681840073007cc7e4f22635af8834e0645ee2cbbabf732938f1",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "The system only prompts the user to select a route if you’ve configured the audio session with a long-form video route-sharing policy.",
      "ko": "시스템은 오디오 세션을 긴 형식 비디오 라우트 공유 정책으로 구성한 경우에만 사용자의 라우트 선택을 요청합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "04869300380e391c1084c585594e583bd60a97905e553c9fe44f599a29ad9f92",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "After the system configures the needed routing, it calls its completion handler, from which you can begin playback.",
      "ko": "시스템이 필요한 라우팅 구성을 완료하면 완료 핸들러를 호출하며, 이때부터 재생을 시작할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "ba5770eaefb35e747e2c49402e32c72227ef65c9f8313803999ce6be2f011931",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nlet session = AVAudioSession.sharedInstance()\nsession.prepareRouteSelectionForPlayback { shouldStartPlayback, routeSelection in\n    if shouldStartPlayback {\n        // Prepare and present player.\n    }\n}\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nlet session = AVAudioSession.sharedInstance()\nsession.prepareRouteSelectionForPlayback { shouldStartPlayback, routeSelection in\n    if shouldStartPlayback {\n        // Prepare and present player.\n    }\n}\n```",
      "sourceHash": "7f487e4aa076f23ee1af8e6d0a188c23ee44e5297b6cc503d937f38c7740595a",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:heading:parameters:0011:0001",
      "source": "Parameters",
      "ko": "Parameters",
      "sourceHash": "e68b36b17cbd990802f57741cb75cf3a73fa66a61999b0cd70e3cf7d26cfb25f",
      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0012:0001",
      "source": "`completionHandler`: A completion handler called after the system finishes preparing the playback route. The system passes the completion handler the following parameters: - **`shouldStartPlayback`**: A Boolean value that indicates whether playback should start.",
      "ko": "`completionHandler`: 시스템이 재생 라우트 준비를 완료한 뒤 호출되는 완료 핸들러입니다. 시스템은 완료 핸들러에 다음 매개변수를 전달합니다. - **`shouldStartPlayback`**: 재생을 시작해야 하는지 나타내는 Boolean 값입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "f7231355ae0f9008afbf910c0c5e72ec4aeaa8cb079309dfc55b799e814bcfac",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:parameters:0012:0002",
      "source": "**`routeSelection`**: A route selection value that indicates the active playback route.",
      "ko": "**`routeSelection`**: 활성 재생 라우트를 나타내는 라우트 선택 값입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "d6df5ce83f8ce11e1351d95cbaa3240477e8e6e9a44a1dd36ab85e9ef9f1c010",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
